"about": "The drafter's scratch census cases (ticket C, PC 'Known before the runs'), for the gate R0: each case of the scratch census under the 21 laws with MET, at the scratch's bounds (6 rounds, at most 300 knots) and with FD 5.8's pair rule (the first eight parts by name, at most eight pairs a round); takes under T1 with the generator string given; s, X, Y (knot names after round s), the meeting round, the reading and the first round it is met; the counts of the first 20 continuations with Y barred (reading met) and with X barred (Y's own), generator strings + '|BY|<s>|<i>' and '|BX|<s>|<i>', i = 0..19. 'values' is ticket A's reading (at least one of the two from X). Also the two values cases read on 1,000 fresh continuations of each kind ('|BN|', '|BY|', '|BX|' and the masked kind '|BM|', i = 1000..1999), with the reading at any round and as values both from X only. The values comparisons used the scratch's sample indices 1,000 to 1,999 for every kind (seeds: the growth's seed followed by '|BN|<s>|<i>', '|BY|<s>|<i>', '|BX|<s>|<i>', '|BM|<s>|<i>'), not DC 4.4's 100 to 1,099. Indices into 'cases' count from 0.",
